  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-ceab0b56a84ecb791ea193d5",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "对于 T=1 s 的闭环系统，闭环传递函数为 Y(z)/R(z) = (0.3678z + 0.2644)/(z^2 - z + 0.6322)。单位阶跃响应得到 Y(z) = 0.3678z^{-1} + z^{-2} + 1.4z^{-3} + 1.4z^{-4} + 1.147z^{-5} ...。超调量为 45%，调节时间为连续系统的两倍。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "For a closed-loop system with T=1 s, the closed-loop transfer function is Y(z)/R(z) = (0.3678z + 0.2644)/(z^2 - z + 0.6322). The unit step response yields Y(z) = 0.3678z^{-1} + z^{-2} + 1.4z^{-3} + 1.4z^{-4} + 1.147z^{-5} ... The overshoot is 45% and settling time is twice that of the continuous system.",
